Carries the deps tag class: the providers a lock file pins and the registry modules some directories' module blocks name, as one hub per tag. terraform = use_extension("@rules_terraform//terraform:extensions.bzl", "terraform") # One `deps` tag per lock file. `lock` brings the providers the lock pins;
# `roots` brings the registry modules named by the `module` blocks in those
# directories (root modules and shared libraries alike). Either may be
# omitted.
terraform.deps( name = "app", lock = "//path/to/module:.terraform.lock.hcl", roots = [ "//path/to/module:main.tf", "//path/to/library:main.tf", ], # registry = "registry.opentofu.org", # optional; defaults to registry.terraform.io
) use_repo(terraform, "app") @app is a terraform_dependency_group: every provider in the lock, the lock itself, and every registry module the roots name. A terraform_module that depends on it needs no lock attribute. @app//:providers and @app//:modules are the two halves, and @app//<namespace>_<name> is one provider. Name the hub after what it serves rather than after the tag. Hubs are alias layers. The archives themselves go into pools shared by every hub of the extension: one repository per distinct provider archive (rt_prov_<registry>_<namespace>_<name>_<version>_<platform>) and one per distinct module archive (rt_mod_<registry>_<address>_<version>), so two hubs that agree on a version fetch and extract it once. Hub names share one namespace across every Bazel module that uses the extension; a duplicate is reported at evaluation time. terraform.deps Attribute Type Description name string (required) Hub repository name. lock label A .terraform.lock.hcl. Every provider it pins is fetched for every platform the registry publishes. roots label_list Directories whose module { source = "…" } blocks name registry modules, each as any .tf file inside it. Every *.tf in each directory is scanned; registry modules composed of other registry modules are followed. root label Shorthand for a one-element roots. registry string (default empty) Registry host to query for lock entries and sources that name none. Empty means registry.terraform.io from this extension, registry.opentofu.org from the OpenTofu one.

